              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They started to argue among themselves, “What shall we say? If we answer, ‘From God,’ he will say to us, ‘Why, then, did you not believe John?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
