          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if we say, ‘From human beings,’ we are afraid of what the people might do, because they are all convinced that John was a prophet.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
